# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if platform is rather different, it may cause dependency resolution issues in other platforms.
#   Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similarly, it is recommended to include poetry.lock in version control.
#   poetry.lock

